# Performance & Security

## Performance

- TanStack Query: use `QUERY_DEFAULTS` from `lib/performance.ts` (60s stale, no focus refetch spam)
- Prefer `prefetch` on primary nav Links
- API calls: pass `signal` / rely on 30s timeout in `apiRequest`
- Keep `app/**/page.tsx` thin — heavy UI in `features/` for clearer code-splitting
- Avoid mirroring large API lists into Zustand

## Security

- Middleware enforces auth + Super Admin + tenant slug match — never rely on UI alone
- Security headers set in `next.config.mjs` (frame deny, nosniff, referrer, permissions)
- Cookies: `SameSite=Lax`; `Secure` in production
- `credentials: "omit"` on API fetch unless backend requires cookies
- Never log access tokens or provider API keys
- RBAC via `lib/rbac` + `<Can>`; backend must still enforce

## Lag prevention checklist

- [ ] No unbounded `useEffect` polling without interval cleanup
- [ ] Charts/lists virtualize or paginate when data is large
- [ ] Mutations `retry: 0` (don’t double-submit)
- [ ] Abort in-flight requests on route change when using custom fetchers
